  "notes": [
    "The receives were signed by the factory's registered signatories, so the defect is the public sendFrom, first used in this tx; the fix (sendFrom internal) shipped 2021-07-03. The 10 July unauthorised-signatory attack is a separate incident (eip155:56:0x83b4adaf).",
    "Victims are the approval holders and the TokenMapped escrows, netted per tx, so only sends the attacker claimed count; unclaimed sends (7.6M ROOM, 2,500 UFARM) were refunded. Rai, CORA and TSHP the attacker later returned are not subtracted.",
